## 4. EAS Android Play — **resume 1 July 2026**

| What | Detail |
|------|--------|
| **Why** | Expo free-tier Android builds exhausted **June 2026**; upload reached EAS but build rejected (quota). |
| **Resume** | **2026-07-01** (quota reset) — production build + Play submit for **v1.3.1** backlog. |
| **Windows task** | `Qwertymates-EAS-Android-July-Release` @ **08:00** daily **1–7 July** — `mobile/scripts/windows/Register-EasAndroidJulyBuildTask.ps1` |
| **Manual** | From `mobile/`: `npm run release:android:play:quota-resume` or `npm run release:android:play` |
| **State / log** | `mobile/exports/eas-android-release-state.json`, `eas-android-release-task.log` |
| **Runbook** | `DOCS/EAS_ANDROID_JULY_BUILD.md` |
| **Rule** | `.cursor/rules/eas-android-july-build.mdc` (`alwaysApply: true`) |

**Agent checks after Cursor updates:** confirm rule file exists; `Get-ScheduledTask -TaskName Qwertymates-EAS-Android-July-Release`; on/after 1 July run `npm run verify:android-release-readiness` then full Play release if quota open.

